```
"/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome" --headless=new --no-sandbox --disable-gpu --use-angle=swiftshader --enable-unsafe-swiftshader --remote-debugging-port=9222 --window-size=1600,900
